<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#183b2a">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <title>Harvest Hollow | Dein Farm-Abenteuer</title>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="landing-shell">
        <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Hauptnavigation">
            <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Harvest Hollow Startseite">
                <span class="brand-mark">HH</span>
                <span>Harvest Hollow</span>
            </a>
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <a class="text-link" href="/login">Einloggen</a>
                <a class="button button-small" href="/register">Spielen</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Dein kleines Stueck Erde</p>
                <h1 id="hero-title">Baue dir ein<br><em>neues Zuhause.</em></h1>
                <p class="hero-text">Pflanze, erkunde und gestalte deine eigene Farm. Ein entspanntes Pixel-Abenteuer wartet auf dich.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="button" href="/register">Jetzt starten <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
                    <a class="quiet-link" href="/login">Ich habe bereits ein Konto</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration einer kleinen Farm" role="img">
                <div class="sun"></div>
                <div class="cloud cloud-one"></div>
                <div class="cloud cloud-two"></div>
                <div class="hill hill-back"></div>
                <div class="hill hill-front"></div>
                <div class="farm-house"><span class="roof"></span><span class="window"></span><span class="door"></span></div>
                <div class="crop-row crop-one"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <div class="crop-row crop-two"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <div class="signpost">FARM<br><small>01</small></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="feature-strip" aria-label="Spielinhalte">
            <article><span class="feature-number">01</span><div><h2>Deine Farm</h2><p>Mach aus wildem Land deinen Lieblingsort.</p></div></article>
            <article><span class="feature-number">02</span><div><h2>Deine Reise</h2><p>Entdecke Wege, Haeuser und kleine Geheimnisse.</p></div></article>
            <article><span class="feature-number">03</span><div><h2>Dein Tempo</h2><p>Spiele entspannt. Jeder Tag bringt etwas Neues.</p></div></article>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>